The `fullstack-project-setup` skill that generated this project has the
complete decision log with self-checks and rejected alternatives for every
rule above, in case you need to understand *why* before proposing a
deviation: see that skill's `reference/architecture-decisions.md`.

## Reference implementation

The `todos` feature (backend `app/features/todos/`,
`packages/hooks/src/queries/todos.ts`, the web `/todos` route, and the
native `TodosScreen`) is a working end-to-end example of every rule above.
When in doubt about how a new feature should be structured, copy its shape.
